    "| `y_train_res` | Label Target Data Training | **1.938 label** | **Seimbang (1:1:1)** |\n",
    "| `X_test` | Matriks Fitur TF-IDF Data Testing | **208 baris $\\times$ 1.000 fitur** | Alami (Distribusi asli data riil) |\n",
    "| `y_test` | Label Target Data Testing | **208 label** | Alami (162 Negatif, 23 Positif, 23 Netral) |"
